  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「おや、お疲れさまです『審査委員長』さん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「皆さんの雪像づくりはどんな案配でしょう、お気に入りの作品は見つかりましたか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でぇへへ、評価して順番つけるのはあんまり好みじゃないんだけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「見てるだけで面白いよ～、芸術的感動♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「もちろん、みんな素人だから技術はたいしたことないんだけどさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「だからこそ興味ぶかいよ、いやぁ収穫いっぱい～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「テーマ選びひとつとっても、君咲学院の校風もあるんだろうけど……。自由で、個性的でさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「雪像をつくるときのちょっとした新技法とか、みんな思いつきをどんどん試してる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「見たことも聞いたこともないような作品が、たっくさん仕上がってるよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「それ見てるだけで、気づかされることがいっぱいあるよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でぇへへ、あたしも自由なつもりでいろいろ凝り固まっちゃってたんだなぁ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「教科書どおりじゃないからさ、みんな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「流行とか歴史とか小難しい理屈とか抜きで、つくりたいものつくってる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「これぞ正しい創作のかたちだよね、ルネッサ～ンス♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「こっちも『あてられ』ちゃってさ、創作意欲がどんどん湧いてくるの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「見てるだけじゃつまんない、あたしも芸術したぁい♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「ふふ。楽しんでいただけているようで、何よりです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「しかし雪像をつくろうにも、もう校内の雪はほとんど使用済みなのですよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「雪かきという本来の目的は達成されたので、こちらとしては万々歳なのですが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「う～ん。雪っていうより、できれば氷がほしいんだけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「『雪祭り』って雪像もあるけど、氷像も『あり』じゃん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ノミとかコテとか彫刻刀とかの道具はあるし、氷なら頑丈だから創作の幅が広がるんだよね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「もっと精緻な作品とか、でっかい大作もつくれちゃうのに～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「『ないものねだり』なのは、わかってるけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「美術部にある粘土とか石膏とかでつくろっかな、でもせっかくの『雪祭り』だし雪とか氷でつくりたいなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-snow",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-snow_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「氷ですか……。季節外れの豪雪でしたが、本来もうあったかくなりつつある季節ですしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「ある程度の量の氷となると、近辺で入手するのは難しいかと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「噴水やプールなども、凍りついてはいませんし。おそらく、遠方から取り寄せるしかないですね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「もっと早く言っていただければ、手配もできたかもしれませんが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
      "y": 526
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「人数ぶんには足りなかった雪かきの道具や、豪華景品などを、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「前生徒会長に空輸していただいたのですが……。先ほど、帰ってしまわれたのですよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「わざわざ呼び戻すのも、どうかと思いますしね。あのひとには、あまり頼りたくないところですし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ともこ",
    "text": "「残念ながら、冴木さんには我慢していただくしかないかと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 6,
    "dress": "old-coat",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-coat_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -6,
